    "title": "TC: Play Games & Earn Rewards",
    "description": "PLAY and WIN with TapChamps! Play the games you love, earn \ud83d\udc8e diamonds then redeem Gift Cards!\r\n\r\nWin gift cards and other prizes just by doing something you already do everyday! Reward card of your choice? Check. Your favorite games? Check. TapChamps is the rewards app that has everything you need to take your gaming experience to the next level.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8eTapChamps is playable by all mobile game enthusiasts alike! TapChamps \u2013 the rewards app that awards you to play the games you already love and introduces you to new ones \u2013 all in one app! So what are you waiting for? Find fun games to play and earn rewards!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Play and Earn rewards! With a growing list of some of the most amazing games around, you can play so many of your favorite games and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 Rewards! Play games and redeem prizes like gift cards. With TapChamps, the more you play the more game rewards you can collect! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Rewards earning is more fun with a community! With the TapChamps rewards app, you invite your friends to play and earn rewards, too!\r\n\r\nThe TapChamps game rewards app is simple to use, so you can start playing the games you love and earn rewards anytime, anywhere:\r\n\r\n1. Download our rewards app and start playing games new or familiar\r\n2. Accumulate \ud83d\udc8e diamonds when you start playing\r\n3. Redeem your \ud83d\udc8e diamonds for amazing rewards and prizes.\r\n4. That\u2019s it \u2013 No forms or additional tasks are required!\r\n\r\nPlay and win with the rewards app, TapChamps. Download today to start playing games and earn \ud83d\udc8e diamonds!\r\n\r\nTapChamps rewarded play is not endorsed, licensed or sponsored by any gift card providers.",
    "descriptionHTML": "PLAY and WIN with TapChamps! Play the games you love, earn \ud83d\udc8e diamonds then redeem Gift Cards!<br><br>Win gift cards and other prizes just by doing something you already do everyday! Reward card of your choice? Check. Your favorite games? Check. TapChamps is the rewards app that has everything you need to take your gaming experience to the next level.<br><br>\ud83d\udc8eTapChamps is playable by all mobile game enthusiasts alike! TapChamps \u2013 the rewards app that awards you to play the games you already love and introduces you to new ones \u2013 all in one app! So what are you waiting for? Find fun games to play and earn rewards!<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Play and Earn rewards! With a growing list of some of the most amazing games around, you can play so many of your favorite games and more.<br><br>\ud83c\udf81 Rewards! Play games and redeem prizes like gift cards. With TapChamps, the more you play the more game rewards you can collect! <br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 Rewards earning is more fun with a community! With the TapChamps rewards app, you invite your friends to play and earn rewards, too!<br><br>The TapChamps game rewards app is simple to use, so you can start playing the games you love and earn rewards anytime, anywhere:<br><br>1. Download our rewards app and start playing games new or familiar<br>2. Accumulate \ud83d\udc8e diamonds when you start playing<br>3. Redeem your \ud83d\udc8e diamonds for amazing rewards and prizes.<br>4. That\u2019s it \u2013 No forms or additional tasks are required!<br><br>Play and win with the rewards app, TapChamps. Download today to start playing games and earn \ud83d\udc8e diamonds!<br><br>TapChamps rewarded play is not endorsed, licensed or sponsored by any gift card providers.",
